Labelled gait video
-------------------
Source:  fahimsohan/CattleLameness (https://github.com/fahimsohan/CattleLameness)
Content: 50 clips — Data/Lame/L (1..25).mp4 (25) and Data/Normal/N (1..25).mp4 (25),
         covering 42 cows, indoor and outdoor, labelled by visual gait characteristics.
Terms:   The dataset's README states the material is for research/education only and
         that the source videos must not be redistributed.

Therefore this repository does NOT contain any dataset video. The clips are downloaded
by `scripts/fetch_dataset.py` into `data/clips/`, which is git-ignored. A clone of this
repository contains no third-party footage. Labels used for evaluation are derived
locally (`data/labels.csv`, also git-ignored) and are not redistributed either.

Any video, frame grab or evidence clip produced by this project for the report or demo
is likewise excluded from version control by `.gitignore` (`*.mp4`, `*.avi`, `*.mov`,
`*.mkv`, `*.webm`, `*.wmv`).

